<%--
Empty_Value - the one muted em-dash for a single empty cell/value

Renders a muted em-dash for a fact with no value (replaces the scattered
`<span class="text-muted">-</span>` and `|| '-'` idioms). For an empty LIST
region use <Empty_State> instead.

Usage:
    <View_Field $label="Fax"><Empty_Value /></View_Field>
--%>
<Define:Empty_Value tag="span">&mdash;</Define:Empty_Value>
